# PROGRESSIVE RELEASE: Note to self
# Worksheets listed here stay local and are not pushed to GitHub.
# To release one, delete its line, then commit and push:
#     git add 2-DataStructures.qmd
#     git commit -m "Release worksheet 2"
#     git push
# Students get it in GitHub Desktop: Fetch origin, then
# Branch -> Update from upstream/main, then Push origin.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
